{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The branch is correct, and the working tree is clean. `bench/` doesn't exist yet, and `tests/` doesn't have `test_bench_client.py` yet. In other words, there's no existing task work that should be preserved, so I need to build it from scratch.\n\nLet me read the spec. First, the sections referenced in the spec: `specs/flashnext/spec.md#r6` and `specs/flashnext/evidence/nix-strix-halo.md`. Also the style reference `scripts/receipts-verify.py`.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Branch is correct, tree clean, no existing `bench/` or `test_bench_client.py`. I need to build from scratch. Let me read the cited spec sections and style references.\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_607743bd980c4dc4bcd7582a","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/70bb1f7ebb6a/bench-harness/specs/flashnext/spec.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen-token-plan","model":"qwen3.8-max","usage":{"input":2135,"output":223,"cacheRead":7168,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":118,"totalTokens":9526,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1787990035435,"responseId":"chatcmpl-13c348d3-869f-4217-b7ad-b35002aa801f","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"}}
