{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now the divergence detection is correct: only spec-on/10240 is divergent (3 distinct fingerprints across 3 loads), and the stable cells have 1 distinct fingerprint each.\n\nNext let's test phase C (the inline Python for serial replay) and phase D (receipt generation). What we need:\n- Synthetic summaries jsonl (what the client outputs per load).\n- Synthetic serial jsonl (what the serial replay generates for the divergent cell).\n\nLet's create summaries jsonl: one JSON object per (arm, load, depth) measurement call, containing \"arm\", \"load\", \"depth_target\", \"concurrency\", and \"fingerprints\" (a list). Fingerprints should match the matrix: for stable cells, identical across all loads; for spec-on/10240, varying per load.\n\nAnd serial jsonl: for the divergent cell spec-on/10240, serial replay at concurrency=1 should be clean (1 distinct fingerprint). Let's create that.\n\nThen run phase D (block 1) with the appropriate env vars and verify bench.json.\n\nLet's build summaries.jsonl and serial-replay.jsonl.\n\nStructure of summaries (per measurement cell = arm × load × depth): for arms spec-off, spec-on; loads 1, 2, 3; depths 0, 10240. Fingerprints per cell = [fp(arm,depth,load)] * 2 (2 requests). fp same as before.\n\nserial-replay.jsonl: only for divergent (spec-on, 10240): {\"arm\":\"spec-on\",\"depth_target\":10240,\"concurrency\":1,\"serial_clean\":true,\"serial_fingerprint\":\"<load1 fp>\",\"serial_distinct_count\":1}.\n\nThen phase D aggregates. Let's run it.\n\nEnvironment variables needed for block 1: BENCH_DIR, RECEIPTS, LOADS_PER_ARM, CONCURRENCY, SCHEDULE_DESC, DEPTH_LIST, ARM_LIST, SUMMARIES_JSONL, SERIAL_JSONL.\n\nLet's set these up and run.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Divergence detection is correct now. Let me test Phase D (receipt assembly) with synthetic summaries + a clean serial replay, then validate the receipt against the receipts gate.\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_269c38639cb2472ba5d8f7b9","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/70bb1f7ebb6a/bench-harness\n# Build synthetic load-summaries.jsonl (client stdout per measured cell) and serial-replay.jsonl\npython3 - <<'GEN'\nimport hashlib, json\ndef fp(arm, depth, load):\n    key = f\"{arm}:{depth}\"\n    if arm==\"spec-on\" and depth==10240: key += f\":load{load}\"\n    return hashlib.sha256(key.encode()).hexdigest()[:16]\nsummaries=[]\nfor arm in (\"spec-off\",\"spec-on\"):\n    for load in (1,2,3):\n        for depth in (0,10240):\n            summaries.append({\"arm\":arm,\"load\":load,\"depth_target\":depth,\n                              \"concurrency\":4,\"requests\":2,\n                              \"queue_wait_s\":0.2,\"prefill_s\":0.05,\n                              \"fingerprints\":[fp(arm,depth,load)]*2})\nwith open(\"/tmp/benchtest/load-summaries.jsonl\",\"w\") as f:\n    for s in summaries: f.write(json.dumps(s)+\"\\n\")\n# Serial replay of the divergent cell is CLEAN (concurrency=1 -> 1 fingerprint).\nserial=[{\"arm\":\"spec-on\",\"depth_target\":10240,\"concurrency\":1,\n         \"serial_clean\":True,\"serial_fingerprint\":fp(\"spec-on\",10240,1),\n         \"serial_distinct_count\":1}]\nwith open(\"/tmp/benchtest/serial-replay.jsonl\",\"w\") as f:\n    for s in serial: f.write(json.dumps(s)+\"\\n\")\nprint(\"wrote summaries + serial\")\nGEN\necho \"=== Phase D ===\"\nBENCH_DIR=/tmp/benchtest RECEIPTS=/tmp/benchtest/receipts \\\nLOADS_PER_ARM=3 CONCURRENCY=4 \\\nSCHEDULE_DESC=\"spec_off:1 spec_on:1 spec_on:2 spec_off:2 spec_off:3 spec_on:3 \" \\\nDEPTH_LIST=\"0 10240 102400\" ARM_LIST=\"spec_off spec_on\" \\\nSUMMARIES_JSONL=/tmp/benchtest/load-summaries.jsonl SERIAL_JSONL=/tmp/benchtest/serial-replay.jsonl \\\npython3 /tmp/rm_block_1.py\necho \"--- bench.json ---\"; python3 -m json.tool /tmp/benchtest/receipts/bench.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen-token-plan","model":"qwen3.8-max","usage":{"input":2418,"output":1079,"cacheRead":118272,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":446,"totalTokens":121769,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1787991499790,"responseId":"chatcmpl-28c39838-b6d9-428e-bdd4-45645939aba0","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_269c38639cb2472ba5d8f7b9","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"wrote summaries + serial\n=== Phase D ===\nrun-matrix: receipt written to /tmp/benchtest/receipts/bench.json (4 cells, 1 suspect)\n--- bench.json ---\n{\n    \"step\": \"bench\",\n    \"status\": \"pass\",\n    \"ts\": \"2026-08-29T10:18:42\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"loads_per_arm\": 3,\n        \"counterbalanced\": true,\n        \"arms\": [\n            \"spec_off\",\n            \"spec_on\"\n        ],\n        \"depth_series\": [\n            0,\n            10240,\n            102400\n        ],\n        \"concurrency\": 4,\n        \"schedule\": [\n            \"spec_off:1\",\n            \"spec_on:1\",\n            \"spec_on:2\",\n            \"spec_off:2\",\n            \"spec_off:3\",\n            \"spec_on:3\"\n        ],\n        \"fingerprints\": {\n            \"spec-off/0\": {\n                \"fingerprints\": [\n                    \"67ed7630c2172ce7\"\n                ],\n                \"loads\": [\n                    1,\n                    2,\n                    3\n                ],\n                \"concurrency\": 4,\n                \"distinct_count\": 1,\n                \"divergent\": false,\n                \"suspect\": false,\n                \"qsa_signature\": false,\n                \"serial_clean\": null,\n                \"serial_fingerprint\": null\n            },\n            \"spec-off/10240\": {\n                \"fingerprints\": [\n                    \"bbf5de8a7bed9595\"\n                ],\n                \"loads\": [\n                    1,\n                    2,\n                    3\n                ],\n                \"concurrency\": 4,\n                \"distinct_count\": 1,\n                \"divergent\": false,\n                \"suspect\": false,\n                \"qsa_signature\": false,\n                \"serial_clean\": null,\n                \"serial_fingerprint\": null\n            },\n            \"spec-on/0\": {\n                \"fingerprints\": [\n                    \"13ffe6bfe2af8504\"\n                ],\n                \"loads\": [\n                    1,\n                    2,\n                    3\n                ],\n                \"concurrency\": 4,\n                \"distinct_count\": 1,\n                \"divergent\": false,\n                \"suspect\": false,\n                \"qsa_signature\": false,\n                \"serial_clean\": null,\n                \"serial_fingerprint\": null\n            },\n            \"spec-on/10240\": {\n                \"fingerprints\": [\n                    \"56706bbe5ff168d7\",\n                    \"646282adbabb33fd\",\n                    \"be4c3ee0be514c0c\"\n                ],\n                \"loads\": [\n                    1,\n                    2,\n                    3\n                ],\n                \"concurrency\": 4,\n                \"distinct_count\": 3,\n                \"divergent\": true,\n                \"suspect\": true,\n                \"qsa_signature\": true,\n                \"serial_clean\": true,\n                \"serial_fingerprint\": \"be4c3ee0be514c0c\"\n            }\n        },\n        \"suspect_cells\": [\n            \"spec-on/10240\"\n        ],\n        \"matrix_csv\": \"results/bench/matrix.csv\",\n        \"medians_csv\": \"results/bench/medians.csv\",\n        \"note\": \"prefill is a server-metrics measurement, never a duplicate of the ttft column (spec 6.2; evidence/nix-strix-halo.md \\u00a74.4). Suspect cells diverged across loads and must not be quoted as clean numbers.\"\n    }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1787991522475}]}
