n":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_a86ba497709744c784812f64","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== FINAL full test suite ===\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 39 tests in 0.117s\n\nOK\n=== FINAL acceptance argv ===\nACCEPTANCE PASS\n=== git add + staged files ===\nA  bench/fn-stream-client.py\nA  bench/run-matrix.sh\nA  tests/test_bench_client.py\n--- staged (name-only) ---\nbench/fn-stream-client.py\nbench/run-matrix.sh\ntests/test_bench_client.py\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1787991711232},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 39 tests pass, acceptance also passes, and only the 3 files within the conflictDomains [bench, tests] are staged. Next, I'll commit to the assigned branch with a clear message.\n\nLet me double-check the branch once more before committing.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"All green. Only the 3 files inside `bench/` and `tests/` are staged. Let me commit on the assigned branch.\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_20f593d600354f299780b666","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/tom/.local/state/tally/campaigns/flashnext/flashnext/70bb1f7ebb6a/bench-harness\necho \"branch: $(git branch --show-current)\"\ngit commit -q -F - <<'MSG'\nbench-harness: honest client and counterbalanced matrix (spec claims 6.2, 6.3)\n\nbench/fn-stream-client.py — streaming benchmark client whose prefill number is\na measurement, not a proxy. It measures per-request time-to-first-token\nclient-side AND scrapes the engine /metrics endpoint to separate scheduler\nqueue wait from prompt processing, so the prefill column is never a duplicate\nof the first-token column (the reference harness shipped prefill_mean_s ==\nttft_mean_s; evidence/nix-strix-halo.md §4.4). Emits CSV with explicit column\nsemantics in a header comment and a sha256 fingerprint of every completion's\ntoken ids.\n\nbench/run-matrix.sh — the counterbalanced matrix per ruling P12: speculative\non/off arms interleaved A-B-B-A, three loads per arm, medians, depth series\n0 / 10240 / 102400, rows under results/, and a receipts-gate-graded bench.json\n{loads_per_arm, counterbalanced:true, arms, fingerprints}. Per the flashnext#4\nsteer it records per-row concurrency and, on fingerprint divergence across an\narm's loads, replays that arm serially (concurrency=1), byte-compares the token\nsequences, and flags the arm suspect rather than averaging over the divergence\n(the QSA-gather signature is recorded, never papered over).\n\ntests/test_bench_client.py — feeds the client parser fixtures with known queue\nand processing times and asserts the two columns separate them, plus the §4.4\nregression guard that prefill is never the first-token column.\nMSG\necho \"=== commit result ===\"\ngit log --oneline -2\necho \"=== working tree clean? ===\"; git status --short && echo \"(clean)\"\necho \"=== verify tracked files are only bench/ + tests/ ===\"\ngit show --stat --oneline HEAD | tail -6"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"qwen-token-plan","model":"qwen3.8-max","usage":{"input":921,"output":590,"cacheRead":132096,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":55,"totalTokens":133607,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1787991711239,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6c1eed6c-cd3d-4f30-8f75-ebc673067cb0","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_20f593d600354f299780b666","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"branch: tally-work/flashnext-70bb1f7ebb6a/bench-harness\n=== commit result ===\n699c257 bench-harness: honest client and counterbalanced matrix (spec claims 6.2, 6.3)\nb474021 host-tooling: Pair-service orchestration: env doctrine, cluster up/down, first-light runner\n=== working tree clean? ===\n(clean)\n=== verify tracked files are only bench/ + tests/ ===\n699c257 bench-harness: honest client and counterbalanced matrix (spec claims 